# OneAccounts - Apply Advance (customers + suppliers)
# Changes 4 existing files and adds 1 new page. Run the two SQL scripts FIRST.
# Safe: every change must match EXACTLY the expected number of times in EVERY file, otherwise NOTHING is written.
# Backups of the original files go OUTSIDE the project (one folder up), so git never picks them up.
